Timer for punspells: I added a timer, so that you cannot cast confused 
spells all the time , but instead you have a timer going down (as in the 
prayer timeout). So if that is down to 0 you can cast a punspell again. 
Otherwise you will receive the message: "You try to cast a spell, but 
instead your (bodypart) starts twitching"

SET ELF ASH: all the elfs on the level are getting burned (just little 
explosiv damage) including the player

All misspelled spells cost additional energy, depending on how many 
monsters are healed/damaged etc.



